---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="AffiliateBharat kya hai, hum kaise research karte hain, aur kya-kya hum kabhi nahi karte — hamari honest methodology."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About' }]} />
  <article class="page">
    <h1>About AffiliateBharat</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      AffiliateBharat <strong>Bharat ka honest buying-guide</strong> hai — Hinglish me researched
      product comparisons, cost calculators aur deals.
    </p>

    <h2>Hum kya karte hain</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Official pricing pages, terms &amp; conditions aur public documents ko khangalte hain.</li>
      <li>Review aggregates (Trustpilot, G2 jaise platforms) se real user patterns nikalte hain.</li>
      <li>Free tools banate hain — hosting compare, website cost calculator — taaki aap khud decide kar sako.</li>
      <li>Har article me <em>last verified</em> date likhte hain, taaki pata rahe ye info kitni taza hai.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Hum kya NAHI karte</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>❌ Fake 'humne khud test kiya' claims — jo test nahi kiya, wo nahi bolte.</li>
      <li>❌ Paid rankings — paise dekar koi product hamari list me upar nahi aa sakta.</li>
      <li>❌ Fake urgency — 'sirf aaj!' wale jhoothe countdowns nahi lagate.</li>
      <li>❌ Chhupi hui sponsorships — har affiliate relationship openly disclose hoti hai.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Hum research kaise karte hain</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Product ki official pricing aur terms padhte hain (intro vs renewal price par khaas dhyaan).</li>
      <li>Independent review platforms par user complaints ke patterns dekhte hain.</li>
      <li>Affiliate program ke public terms check karte hain — taaki hamari apni bias bhi transparent rahe.</li>
      <li>Article publish karne se pehle facts verify karte hain aur date note karte hain.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Hum paise kaise kamate hain</h2>
    <p>
      Jab aap hamare affiliate links se kuch kharidte hain to humein commission mil sakta hai —
      <strong>aapko koi extra cost nahi lagta</strong>. Ye commission hamari rankings ya verdicts
      ko influence nahi karta. Puri policy <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure page</a> par padhein.
    </p>

    <h2>Founder</h2>
    <div class="founder">
      <img src="/images/firoz-khan.jpg" alt="Firoz Khan — founder of AffiliateBharat" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" />
      <div>
        <p class="founder-name"><strong>Firoz Khan</strong></p>
        <p>
          Firoz Khan is a technology-focused content creator and developer who works on
          practical online tools and digital resources. He is the founder/creator behind
          FurTools, a pet-focused platform designed to make everyday pet care information,
          calculations, planning, and educational resources easier to access.
        </p>
        <p class="socials">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@fkdigitalmedia" target="_blank" rel="noopener">▶ YouTube</a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/rtibyfiroz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">📸 Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/fkdigitalmedia" target="_blank" rel="noopener">💻 GitHub</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Sampark karein</h2>
    <p>
      Sawal, correction ya partnership ke liye humein email karein:
      <a href="mailto:hello@affiliatebharat.com">hello@affiliatebharat.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 760px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page h2 { margin: 2.2rem 0 0.8rem; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .page ul, .page ol { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
  .page li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .founder { display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: flex-start; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .founder img { border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid var(--border); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .founder-name { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
  .founder p { margin: 0 0 0.7rem; }
  .socials a { margin-right: 1rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .founder { flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
